pps/1569350/extras/16d5e7023e6745cdd622eedbff14d6d6.webm?t=1617996294\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1569350/extras/16d5e7023e6745cdd622eedbff14d6d6.mp4?t=1617996294\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Four varied environments to explore : surreal, improbable places that feel like a dark dreamscape<br></li><li>Low risk gameplay : no enemies putting the player in danger, just a tense and heavy atmosphere<br></li><li>Disturbing narrative : true-crime style events are implied, but never shown</li></ul><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1569350/extras/b55aaa2fa5b4ebbb867cdaf057433acb.poster.avif?t=1617996294\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1569350/extras/b55aaa2fa5b4ebbb867cdaf057433acb.webm?t=1617996294\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1569350/extras/b55aaa2fa5b4ebbb867cdaf057433acb.mp4?t=1617996294\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">What's new in Steam Edition</h2>Similar to a director's cut, this version of <i>I Make Saints</i> contains material that was originally cut from the initial release, such as :<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>An entirely new environment : walk the halls of the orphanage and shed some light on the past of the protagonist<br></li><li>Unused dark ambient musical track has been added back to the game<br></li><li>Minor changes to existing environments to ensure a better flow throughout</li></ul><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1569350/extras/fa94aed2e1a69d04292b0a9aa215e82f.poster.avif?t=1617996294\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1569350/extras/fa94aed2e1a69d04292b0a9aa215e82f.webm?t=1617996294\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1569350/extras/fa94aed2e1a69d04292b0a9aa215e82f.mp4?t=1617996294\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
